<!--
  Wavetype Pro Sparkle appcast.

  Hosting target: https://2amlabs.github.io/wavetype/appcast.xml
  Releases live next to it under /releases/Wavetype-Pro-X.Y.dmg.

  Each new release: run scripts/sparkle_release.sh on the notarized DMG and
  paste the printed <item> block above the previous one inside <channel>.
  Sparkle picks the highest sparkle:version that the current OS satisfies
  (sparkle:minimumSystemVersion).

  Do NOT commit Wavetype-Pro-*.dmg files to a private repo — they belong on
  the public Pages branch.
-->
